cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this list in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Awesome LLM Specifications"
abstract: >-
  A curated collection of papers, benchmarks, and tools on inferring,
  generating, and using specifications for software with large language
  models, covering postconditions, contracts, loop invariants, test
  oracles, temporal-logic properties, and the verification pipelines
  built on top of them.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Fakhoury
    given-names: Sarah
    alias: Smfakhoury
repository-code: "https://github.com/Smfakhoury/awesome-llm-specifications"
url: "https://github.com/Smfakhoury/awesome-llm-specifications"
keywords:
  - large language models
  - specification inference
  - formal specifications
  - program verification
  - test oracles
  - loop invariants
  - software engineering
license: CC0-1.0
